    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7463bc892d70375485b82c39",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这次如同交付的资料上所写，\n是对谈形式！我们还把这里包下来，\n方便好好地深入了解川上公主的魅力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c6734d5bcb01c6e80a521be4a84e965bde9561d645d1e7012cdf8ef2e1b0df1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
