    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bbbb2572f3cc06e033e5da4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7502b34080407f2385fc94d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "路过的人们一脸狐疑地看着\n吵架吵到店外都听得见的两人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c1cb45540908ef5fd704b09e226196c40fdfedaefc773e2ce513dd71f33d5e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a91358036e468d7284bc0674",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "节目制作人",
      "source_fingerprint": "c81fe7057582e7928de5204e62cad3bfae832baed8ffef40d68bd7cd067b8c4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de211412fbd91b079a2c2a4f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "放心吧。如果有什么不方便播出的部分，\n可以通知我们剪掉。\n顺带一提，我们节目并不避讳这样的争执场面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50deb514d63cfcc6377b2f77fcebde79371923d0b711bc44a65d8289d7af46f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb0f35259128e637bc6a3952",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "节目制作人",
      "source_fingerprint": "c81fe7057582e7928de5204e62cad3bfae832baed8ffef40d68bd7cd067b8c4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be2c453e1efb980935998b3a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想要录下她们自然不做作的对话。\n不觉得她们两个\n真的很有实力又有魅力吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fded52ad2ffc1bd4e501b0f83e5207323c8e4659af1a457ebdd17055d88d952",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dbf5de1bec39e31b7ab1a1c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……有什么特别的原因让你这么想吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f441b16b9886be2977132c477ce5f7ae9e0706a6e5d4d4c7c2273f5fa98f4378",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:627a8020e303c1bc9b56905b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "节目制作人",
      "source_fingerprint": "c81fe7057582e7928de5204e62cad3bfae832baed8ffef40d68bd7cd067b8c4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebabf33c566b11548c305ceb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有的赛马娘就算没有特别塑造形象，\n也能借着自我本色在后冠路线发光发热。\n……我希望可以让观众们了解到这一点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84c76c6b93fae2afcc8f03ccb30fabe17e66dbe6d9286172ec8e60d036829b21",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f769e6222eabb87505111ba7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "节目制作人",
      "source_fingerprint": "c81fe7057582e7928de5204e62cad3bfae832baed8ffef40d68bd7cd067b8c4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd02048dbe0f0992d606e433",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈哈，这说来也挺不好意思的。\n我好朋友的女儿是赛马娘，她从以前\n就很向往后冠路线。可是前阵子──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f960b008ba687f03bb7d73efe70ddeb462026a6a666dc3e51269334af3a5c92c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f25cfe1afc681b074c486f5a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "节目制作人",
      "source_fingerprint": "c81fe7057582e7928de5204e62cad3bfae832baed8ffef40d68bd7cd067b8c4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:101a3faeb5895213d8004c15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她说\n‘我已经死心了，因为我一点也不可爱，\n小学的朋友也说……我的气质不适合后冠’。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc7cf0fb779c529698ebfc791d0c1f580870956f8664f10bbdd15f160dc4a146",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c52e1dd562594adccdb1d4c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“不适合”啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e129888aa0421e46f9301ed59b80c1ef26e471b6d9491ed55e9d7cc68b9a4d4c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1cbc2ab169f0953b0e28048",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "节目制作人",
      "source_fingerprint": "c81fe7057582e7928de5204e62cad3bfae832baed8ffef40d68bd7cd067b8c4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1424a14d5719fd76f55aad71",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我不懂这有什么气质适不适合的问题。\n这种言语的影响力真的有大到足以\n剥夺一个人挑战梦想的勇气吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "172d6b26b9a3c432738a6bddc563d1fdc2b87cb78bddbb81a8a86e02e07a755d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea633b0140d8133be3b70cbd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东商变革",
      "source_fingerprint": "7281a4e36830a49e7bf9024c39a41d6bf86957e1a7ed32a98967bb65c8a03663",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e594a7b1ddad66a0e5b0bfbf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可恶～～气死我了！\n你给我来参加今年的“伊丽莎白女王杯”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24feee59c884fb6947f2d79da408c54c5a15b4dee09d13cc72ea563d1f8a924e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e3f016a714cd8a3cac9f334",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "川上公主",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fdad786a4d6323b0540a6036476cf92ac347face738a3822759994bd866a68a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9a3db2a4066b77ddb19825f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "包、包下来！？所以现在是我专用的咖啡厅！？\n简直是公主级待遇……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4a79d37ad7cfceb78801d1614db40555cf02e7342b3465782849dd4be803cd7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039115.json",
      "json_path": [
